00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:02.241
-A chicken restaurant?
-Olive Oyl.

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:03.542
-Popeye!
-Yeah!

00:09:03.542 --> 00:09:06.546
-Popeye's.
-Yeah.

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:09.148
-It's the last day of the week.
-Friday.

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:10.849
-Yes.
-TGIF.

00:09:10.849 --> 00:09:12.818
-Yes. What are the words?
-"Thank God It's Friday."

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:14.853
-Oh, my goodness. You're good!

00:09:14.853 --> 00:09:17.056
-I can't walk because I have --

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.257
-Broken leg.

00:09:18.257 --> 00:09:20.192
-No, I have --
-You can't -- you have two --

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:23.862
You can't walk because
you have high heels.

00:09:23.862 --> 00:09:24.963
-No.
-No.

00:09:24.963 --> 00:09:25.964
You have sore feet!

00:09:25.964 --> 00:09:28.700
-I can't walk 'cause I have --

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.569
-You have tight pants?

00:09:30.569 --> 00:09:32.104
[ Laughter ]

00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:33.672
-You have two...
You're paralyzed.

00:09:33.672 --> 00:09:35.173
-What's this?
-Your foot.

00:09:35.173 --> 00:09:37.143
-Yeah. I have.
-Two left feet!

00:09:37.143 --> 00:09:38.977
-Ahh!

00:09:38.977 --> 00:09:40.212
[ Buzzer ]

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:43.649
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:46.051
[ Buzzer dings ]

00:09:46.051 --> 00:09:50.556
-That's the strategy,
right there!

00:09:50.556 --> 00:09:53.592
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:53.592 --> 00:09:57.396
Thanks to Will Smith,
Kirsten Dunst, Tariq Trotter!

